     "title": "Parts and jobs",
     "md": "**Roots** hold the plant in the soil and take in water. The **stem** holds the plant up and carries water to the leaves. **Leaves** make food for the plant using sunlight (this is **photosynthesis**). The **flower** makes seeds, and the **fruit** holds the seeds. A **seed** can grow into a new plant."
