     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "What plants need",
     "md": "Plants need **light**, **water**, **air** (carbon dioxide), **warmth** and **soil** (for minerals and support). A seed needs **water, air and warmth** to start to grow (**germinate**); it does not need light at first. First the **root** comes out, then the **shoot** grows up towards the light."
    },
