     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Common mistakes",
     "md": "- Thinking that plants eat soil: they take water and minerals from the soil and make their own food in the leaves.\n- Saying that leaves take in water: the **roots** take in water.\n- Thinking that a seed needs sunlight to germinate."
    },
